/E (Take time this May to explore what sparks joy, brings you peace, or helps you feel good. Often, we put our own well-being on the back burner in favor of taking care of others. Or, don't give ourselves time to reflect on what we really need to feel well. Remember that relaxation, hobbies, and creative pursuits are crucial for our mental health and well-being! The path may look different for everyone, but we all deserve more good days, together. )
